DIM SHARED CUT_ZIPNAME(1 TO CUT_MAXAFRAME) AS STRING * 96
DIM SHARED CUT_ZIPMETHOD(1 TO CUT_MAXAFRAME) AS LONG
DIM SHARED CUT_ZIPCSIZE(1 TO CUT_MAXAFRAME) AS _UNSIGNED LONG
